{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "3 · Email/password submit → attempt → organization destination",
  "description": "User submits the credentials form. Choose signup or signin mode.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/presentation/auth-view.tsx",
      "line": 32,
      "title": "AuthForm.submit",
      "description": "preventDefault; read FormData; call flow.submit(credentials). The verification branch instead calls flow.verify.\n\nTransition: DOM submit callback"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/application/flow.ts",
      "line": 118,
      "title": "AuthenticationFlow.submit",
      "description": "Validate email/password and state. Choose gateway.signup or gateway.signin inside run(); these are alternate branches.\n\nTransition: calls run + gateway"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/application/flow.ts",
      "line": 67,
      "title": "AuthenticationFlow.run",
      "description": "Mark pending; execute the supplied operation; catch actionable errors; race 30-second deadline. Control returns to the operation after awaited gateway calls.\n\nTransition: awaits operation"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/infrastructure/clerk-gateway.ts",
      "line": 55,
      "title": "createClerkGateway.signup",
      "description": "Signup calls signUp.password then signupState; signin instead calls signIn.password then signinState. requireSuccess throws returned SDK errors.\n\nTransition: SDK boundary → return Attempt"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/application/flow.ts",
      "line": 96,
      "title": "AuthenticationFlow.advance",
      "description": "After the attempt returns, submit may send the first code, then calls advance. verification → update snapshot and stop; ready → gateway.activate.\n\nTransition: conditional call"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/infrastructure/clerk-gateway.ts",
      "line": 94,
      "title": "createClerkGateway.activate",
      "description": "Recheck ready/verified; call the matching SDK finalize. SDK invokes navigate callback, which permits choose-organization and decorates the destination.\n\nTransition: SDK callback → return URL"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/application/flow.ts",
      "line": 96,
      "title": "AuthenticationFlow.advance",
      "description": "After activation returns, generation must still match. Mark complete; call injected complete(destination). Stale activation deactivates instead.\n\nTransition: completion callback"
    },
    {
      "file": "apps/web/src/features/auth/presentation/clerk-auth.tsx",
      "line": 40,
      "title": "ClerkAuth.complete",
      "description": "complete callback uses window.location.assign for HTTPS, otherwise router.replace + refresh. Navigation starts a new request to /organizations.\n\nTransition: navigation handoff"
    },
    {
      "title": "Branches and stop conditions",
      "description": "Verification required: submit changes state before sending the first email code; advance returns without activation. Continue with journey 4.\n\nAlready ready: submit reuses lastAttempt and retries activation; it does not submit credentials again.\n\nInvalid fields → local error; duplicates/pending → early return; SDK errors → recovery message; timeout increments generation to block late completion.\n\nThe private invitation mode remains in the controller/adapter but is not exposed by the current public routes.\n\nUI “Home” labels are stale wording in existing source: the actual complete destination is /organizations. The guide follows execution rather than that text."
    }
  ]
}
